<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Assmang final dividend 500 cents.</title>
<headline>Assmang final dividend 500 cents.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Type of share: ordinary</p>
<p>Final div: 500 cents</p>
<p>Pay date: October 25</p>
<p>Record date: October 4</p>
<p>Full name: Associated Manganese Mines of South Africa Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The estimated consolidated profit before tax and the state's share of profits attributable to the company for the year to June 30, 1996 was 204.14 million rand versus 105.84 million. Tax absorbed was 51.46 million (vs 41.57 million).</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
